!!! archon/model/finding.mat
!!! The atomic unit of an Archon scan.
!!!
!!! A finding is the whole record of one observed issue: what rule found it,
!!! how serious and how certain it is, which surface it is on, exactly where it
!!! was observed, and what to do about it. It is data first: a human interface,
!!! an agent and a policy decision all read this one shape.

book archon.model.finding

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from archon.model.severity
read everything from archon.model.confidence
read everything from archon.model.category
read everything from archon.model.location

public finding begin record
    field identity as number
    field rule-id as text
    field title as text
    field detail as text
    field level as severity
    field certainty as confidence
    field domain as category
    field place as location
    field guidance as text
end record

!!! A one-line human summary.
public finding-summary receives item as finding returns text begin paragraph
    give (severity-name with level being item.level)
        plus ": "
        plus item.title
        plus " at "
        plus (location-summary with place being item.place)
end paragraph
